string	string
meta title=True	meta include=True
Shipping	Standard shipping takes 5 to 7 business days and costs $6.95. Orders over $75 ship free. Express shipping takes 2 business days and costs $19.95. Orders placed before 2 p.m. Eastern time on a business day leave the warehouse the same day. We ship to the United States and Canada only. Canadian orders take 8 to 12 business days, and the carrier may charge import duties. Express shipping is not available to PO boxes.
Returns	You may return any unused item within 45 days of delivery for a full refund to the original payment method. Items must have their tags and original packaging. Return shipping is free when you use the prepaid label in your order confirmation email; otherwise the customer pays return shipping. Refunds are issued within 7 business days after the warehouse receives the item. Final-sale items marked Last Chance cannot be returned. A gift receipt allows an exchange or store credit, but not a cash refund.
Warranty	Our hiking boots carry a 2-year warranty against defects in materials and workmanship. Backpacks and tents are covered for 5 years. The warranty does not cover normal wear, damage from misuse, or fading from sunlight. To make a claim, email warranty@harboroutfitters.example with your order number and a photo of the problem. We will repair, replace, or refund the item at our discretion within 10 business days of approving a claim.
Accounts	You can create an account with an email address and a password of at least 12 characters. To reset a forgotten password, choose Forgot Password on the sign-in page; the reset link expires after 30 minutes. After 5 failed sign-in attempts the account is locked for 15 minutes. You can change your email address in Account Settings, and we send a confirmation link to the new address before the change takes effect.
Payment	We accept Visa, Mastercard, American Express, and PayPal. We do not accept checks or cash on delivery. Your card is charged when the order ships, not when it is placed. If an item is on backorder, you are charged only for the items in each shipment. Sales tax is calculated at checkout based on the shipping address. You may use up to two gift cards on a single order.
Harbor Club	Harbor Club members earn 1 point for every dollar spent and 2 points for every dollar spent on boots. 500 points can be redeemed for a $10 reward certificate. Points expire 18 months after they are earned. Members get early access to sales and free standard shipping on every order, with no minimum. Membership is free.
Trail Box	Trail Box is a monthly subscription of trail snacks and small gear for $24 per month. You can pause or cancel at any time from Account Settings. To avoid the next charge, cancel at least 3 days before your renewal date. Skipped months are not charged. Boxes ship on the 15th of each month.
Price Adjustments and Damage	If the price of an item you bought drops within 14 days of delivery, contact support for an adjustment to the new price. Price adjustments are not available on Last Chance items or on doorbuster deals. If your order arrives damaged, report it within 7 days with photos, and we will ship a replacement at no charge or refund you.
